@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
actor Payer
actor "Email System" as Mail
actor "System Timer" as Timer
rectangle "Tuition Payment Subsystem" {
  usecase "Log in" as UC1
  usecase "Sign out" as UC12
  usecase "View profile & balance" as UC2
  usecase "Look up tuition by MSSV" as UC3
  usecase "Pay tuition" as UC4
  usecase "Verify OTP" as UC5
  usecase "Execute transaction\n(debit, mark tuition paid)" as UC6
  usecase "Resend OTP" as UC7
  usecase "View transaction history" as UC8
  usecase "Resume pending payment" as UC9
  usecase "Cancel pending payment" as UC10
  usecase "Expire unconfirmed payment\n(release tuition hold)" as UC11
  usecase "Refund failed payment" as UC13
}
Payer --> UC1
Payer --> UC12
Payer --> UC2
Payer --> UC3
Payer --> UC4
Payer --> UC8
Payer --> UC9
Payer --> UC10
UC4 ..> UC3 : <<include>>
UC4 ..> UC5 : <<include>>
UC4 ..> UC6 : <<include>>
UC7 ..> UC5 : <<extend>>
UC9 ..> UC5 : <<include>>
UC13 ..> UC6 : <<extend>>\ntuition commit refused
Timer --> UC11
Mail <-- UC5 : OTP email
Mail <-- UC6 : receipt email
note right of UC1
  Every use case except "Log in"
  requires a logged-in Payer (JWT).
end note
@enduml
